  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "European leaders gathered in Brussels ",
        "zh": "歐洲領袖齊聚布魯塞爾，"
      },
      {
        "en": "for a special summit scheduled ",
        "zh": "參加一場特別峰會，"
      },
      {
        "en": "for November 26 and 27, 2026. ",
        "zh": "會期訂於2026年11月26至27日。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The central issue was the EU's ",
        "zh": "核心議題是歐盟"
      },
      {
        "en": "long-term budget for 2028 to 2034. ",
        "zh": "2028至2034年的長期預算。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Opening remarks published on November 26 ",
        "zh": "11月26日發布的開場談話"
      },
      {
        "en": "set out the challenge: ",
        "zh": "點出了這項挑戰："
      },
      {
        "en": "funding more priorities while limiting ",
        "zh": "既要為更多優先事項提供資金，又要限制"
      },
      {
        "en": "the burden on national budgets.",
        "zh": "各國預算的負擔。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "European Council President Antonio Costa ",
        "zh": "歐洲理事會主席安東尼歐・科斯塔"
      },
      {
        "en": "identified three questions for negotiations. ",
        "zh": "指出談判有三個問題。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Leaders needed to consider ",
        "zh": "領袖們需要考量"
      },
      {
        "en": "the total size of the budget, ",
        "zh": "預算總額、"
      },
      {
        "en": "how money would be divided, ",
        "zh": "資金如何分配，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and where new revenue would come from. ",
        "zh": "以及新增收入從何而來。"
      },
      {
        "en": "These questions are closely connected. ",
        "zh": "這些問題密切相關。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A larger list of ambitions ",
        "zh": "若目標清單擴大，"
      },
      {
        "en": "does not automatically provide ",
        "zh": "並不會自動帶來"
      },
      {
        "en": "the money to pay for them.",
        "zh": "足以實現目標的資金。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Costa described a wide range ",
        "zh": "科斯塔說明了廣泛的"
      },
      {
        "en": "of needs competing for attention. ",
        "zh": "待處理需求。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They included support for farmers, ",
        "zh": "其中包括支持農民、"
      },
      {
        "en": "cities, and regions, alongside ",
        "zh": "城市與地方，同時還要"
      },
      {
        "en": "greater investment in security and defence. ",
        "zh": "增加安全與國防投資。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He also mentioned competitiveness ",
        "zh": "他也提到競爭力，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and public expectations concerning ",
        "zh": "以及民眾對"
      },
      {
        "en": "energy prices and housing. ",
        "zh": "能源價格與住房的期待。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His message connected the budget ",
        "zh": "他的談話將預算"
      },
      {
        "en": "with both strategic challenges ",
        "zh": "同時連結到戰略挑戰"
      },
      {
        "en": "and pressures in everyday life.",
        "zh": "與日常生活的壓力。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The summit agenda described a proposal ",
        "zh": "峰會議程說明了一份提案，"
      },
      {
        "en": "Costa had presented on November 21. ",
        "zh": "由科斯塔於11月21日提出。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It sought a balance ",
        "zh": "其目標是在"
      },
      {
        "en": "between newer strategic priorities ",
        "zh": "較新的戰略優先事項"
      },
      {
        "en": "and established policies such as agriculture. ",
        "zh": "與農業等既有政策之間取得平衡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It also included possible revenue ",
        "zh": "其中也包含可能的收入，"
      },
      {
        "en": "from areas including digital services ",
        "zh": "來源包括數位服務"
      },
      {
        "en": "and non-recycled electronic waste. ",
        "zh": "與未回收電子廢棄物等領域。"
      },
      {
        "en": "These were elements under discussion, ",
        "zh": "這些都是討論中的項目，"
      },
      {
        "en": "rather than proof of a completed agreement.",
        "zh": "並不代表協議已經完成。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The long-term budget provides a framework ",
        "zh": "長期預算提供一套架構，"
      },
      {
        "en": "for spending across several years. ",
        "zh": "用來規劃跨年度支出。"
      },
      {
        "en": "According to the Council's background explanation, ",
        "zh": "根據理事會的背景說明，"
      },
      {
        "en": "it sets ceilings for annual commitments ",
        "zh": "它為每年的承諾支出"
      },
      {
        "en": "and payments. ",
        "zh": "與實際支付額設定上限。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A commitment is a legal obligation, ",
        "zh": "承諾支出是一項法律義務，"
      },
      {
        "en": "such as a grant or contract. ",
        "zh": "例如補助或合約。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The payment may take place later. ",
        "zh": "款項則可能稍後才支付。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Agreeing to fund a project ",
        "zh": "同意資助一項計畫，"
      },
      {
        "en": "therefore does not mean ",
        "zh": "因此不等於"
      },
      {
        "en": "all its money leaves immediately.",
        "zh": "全部資金立即支出。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Predictability is one reason ",
        "zh": "可預測性是"
      },
      {
        "en": "for planning over several years. ",
        "zh": "進行跨年度規劃的原因之一。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The framework helps beneficiaries ",
        "zh": "這套架構有助受益者"
      },
      {
        "en": "understand the overall financial limits ",
        "zh": "了解整體財務限制，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and makes annual budgeting easier. ",
        "zh": "也讓年度預算編列更容易。"
      },
      {
        "en": "However, unexpected events can change priorities. ",
        "zh": "然而，突發事件可能改變優先順序。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The system includes special instruments ",
        "zh": "因此，這套制度設有特別工具，"
      },
      {
        "en": "to provide flexibility during crises. ",
        "zh": "在危機期間提供彈性。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Stable planning and room to respond ",
        "zh": "穩定的規劃與應變空間"
      },
      {
        "en": "are both part of its design.",
        "zh": "都是其設計的一部分。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "An invitation published on November 24 ",
        "zh": "11月24日公布的邀請函"
      },
      {
        "en": "also placed Ukraine's financing needs ",
        "zh": "也將烏克蘭的資金需求"
      },
      {
        "en": "for 2027 on the agenda. ",
        "zh": "列入議程，聚焦2027年。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Costa linked that support ",
        "zh": "科斯塔將這項支持"
      },
      {
        "en": "with Europe's own security. ",
        "zh": "連結到歐洲自身的安全。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The letter planned discussions ",
        "zh": "信中規劃了"
      },
      {
        "en": "with all leaders and separate meetings, ",
        "zh": "全體領袖討論及個別會談，"
      },
      {
        "en": "allowing space for reactions ",
        "zh": "讓各方有機會回應"
      },
      {
        "en": "and attempts to find compromise.",
        "zh": "並嘗試尋求妥協。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Reaching political agreement is one stage. ",
        "zh": "達成政治共識只是其中一個階段。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Formal adoption of the budget regulation ",
        "zh": "正式通過預算規章，"
      },
      {
        "en": "requires unanimous approval in the Council ",
        "zh": "需要歐盟理事會一致同意，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and consent from the European Parliament. ",
        "zh": "以及歐洲議會的同意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The opening statements explain ",
        "zh": "開場聲明說明了"
      },
      {
        "en": "what leaders wanted to achieve; ",
        "zh": "領袖們希望達成的目標；"
      },
      {
        "en": "they do not establish the final outcome. ",
        "zh": "但並未確定最終結果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The key question is how ",
        "zh": "關鍵在於如何"
      },
      {
        "en": "shared ambitions become an agreed plan ",
        "zh": "把共同目標化為各方同意的計畫，"
      },
      {
        "en": "with workable funding and legal approval.",
        "zh": "並具備可行的資金安排與法律核准。"
      }
    ]
  ],
